        "@value": "Follow the story of Matilda, a brilliant and brave young girl with special powers, as she overcomes neglectful parents and a tyrannical headmistress to inspire a rebellion among her fellow students. Packed with catchy songs, high-energy dance numbers, and unforgettable characters, Matilda JR. is the"
